"transhuman" to describe what we are aiming for?  Certainly "trans-"
*can* mean "beyond", but in most contructions is means "across", and if
interpreted like that, is meaningless in a construction like
"transhumanism", unless one takes it to imply something akin to
"one-worldism".  I'd meant to suggest replacing this shaky meme with
something more apt, like posthumanism.  Just a morsel for thought. 

